    #[tool(
        description = "Run a slot dashboard's command by `id` from command_list, with optional `args` for the page. The app reveals the dashboard's slot if it is closed and delivers the command once, after the page is ready, as the person's chord does. Returns {requested:true} once dispatched; the page acts on its own. Refused with `denied: grant` when the dashboard's policy grant lacks commands:run, `denied: … is for humans only` for a humanOnly command, `unavailable:` for an inactive one, and `unknown command` for an id command_list doesn't list. The page verb codesense.commands.run(id, args) does the same for the person."
    )]
